== Description ==

'''Log Pillar''' is a building material in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Carpentry Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Carpentry Workbench]], including [[Wood pillar]], [[Spiked Trunk]], [[Spiked Great Trunk]], [[Pillar 1.5m]], [[Bladed Pole]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

